{{!-- The menu entry of the Linux packages. tauri.linux.conf.json sets productName to gpxcam-card,
so the package and .desktop file names have no spaces; the menu still shows "gpxcam card".
Tauri's own template (tauri-bundler, freedesktop/main.desktop) with Name fixed. --~}}
[Desktop Entry]
Categories={{categories}}
{{#if comment}}
Comment={{comment}}
{{/if}}
Exec={{exec}}
StartupWMClass={{exec}}
Icon={{icon}}
Name=gpxcam card
Terminal=false
Type=Application
